since $x_{j1}+x_{j2}=r$. However by (\ref{Pr7}) and (\ref{Pr03}) we have $a_{j1}+a_{j2}+r \leq \Delta(\mathcal{G}_1) + \Delta(\mathcal{G}_2)$ which gives a contradiction.
